{
    "name": "venn.odontobox360",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "private": true,
    "//packageManager": "AUSENTE DE PROPÓSITO, por robustez em CI e não pelo motivo que eu supunha. O campo faz o Node delegar ao corepack, e o corepack PERGUNTA antes de baixar uma versão que não tenha em cache — num builder não interativo não há quem responda. Cheguei a atribuir a ele as falhas de build de 12/11; não era (os builds não chegaram a executar na Cloudflare). A armadilha do prompt é real de todo modo, e o pin não se perde: o `pnpm-lock.yaml` é lockfileVersion 9.0 (lido por pnpm 9 e 10) e o Workers Builds escolhe o pnpm pelo lockfile (o ci.yml do GitHub morreu em 13/11 — ver scripts/ci-worker.mjs). Se este campo voltar, a build var COREPACK_ENABLE_DOWNLOAD_PROMPT=0 tem de vir com ele.",
    "scripts": {
        "dev": "next dev",
        "build": "pnpm --filter @venn/db run generate && next build",
        "start": "next start",
        "lint": "eslint",
        "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
        "lint:colors": "node scripts/lint-colors.mjs",
        "lint:estaticos": "node scripts/lint-colors.mjs && node scripts/lint-workspace.mjs && node scripts/lint-fuso.mjs && node scripts/check-widget.mjs && node scripts/check-tailwind.mjs",
        "prebuild": "pnpm run lint:estaticos",
        "verificar": "node scripts/limpar-tipos-gerados.mjs && pnpm run typecheck && pnpm run typecheck:cloudflare && pnpm run lint:estaticos",
        "prebuild:preview": "pnpm run ci:worker",
        "ci:worker": "node scripts/ci-worker.mjs",
        "preportao:stg": "pnpm run verificar",
        "preportao:prod": "pnpm run verificar",
        "check:period": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-period.ts",
        "check:operacao": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-operacao.ts",
        "test:availability": "tsx scripts/test-availability.ts",
        "check:widget": "node scripts/check-widget.mjs",
        "check:tailwind": "node scripts/check-tailwind.mjs",
        "test:widget-config": "tsx scripts/test-widget-config.ts",
        "test:fuso-unidade": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/test-fuso-unidade.ts",
        "lint:workspace": "node scripts/lint-workspace.mjs",
        "lint:fuso": "node scripts/lint-fuso.mjs",
        "check:cofre": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-cofre.ts",
        "check:neon": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-neon.ts",
        "check:storage": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-storage.ts",
        "check:auth": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-auth.ts",
        "migrar:usuarios": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/migrar-usuarios.ts",
        "check:trabalhos": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-trabalhos.ts",
        "check:funil": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-funil.ts",
        "check:gatilhos": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-gatilhos.ts",
        "check:sns": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-sns.ts",
        "check:sns:assinatura": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-sns-assinatura.ts",
        "check:envelopes": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-envelopes.ts",
        "check:filas": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-filas.ts",
        "check:tenant": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-tenant.ts",
        "check:tempo-real": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-tempo-real.ts",
        "typecheck:cloudflare": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.cloudflare.json",
        "dev:vinext": "BUILD_TARGET=cloudflare vite dev --port 3001",
        "build:vinext": "BUILD_TARGET=cloudflare vite build",
        "start:vinext": "BUILD_TARGET=cloudflare vite preview",
        "deploy:vinext": "BUILD_TARGET=cloudflare vinext-cloudflare deploy",
        "build:preview": "DEPLOY_ENV=stg BUILD_TARGET=cloudflare CF_PREVIEW=1 vite build",
        "deploy:preview": "DEPLOY_ENV=stg BUILD_TARGET=cloudflare CF_PREVIEW=1 vinext-cloudflare previews deploy",
        "check:fuso": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/check-fuso.ts",
        "check:paridade": "tsx scripts/check-paridade.ts",
        "audit:isolation": "node scripts/audit-isolation.mjs",
        "migrate:prod": "node scripts/migrate-guarded.mjs --expect-slug odontobox --expect-env production",
        "migrate:stg": "node scripts/migrate-guarded.mjs --expect-slug odontobox --expect-env stg",
        "portao:prod": "pnpm run migrate:prod && pnpm run audit:isolation -- --strict",
        "portao:stg": "pnpm run migrate:stg && pnpm run audit:isolation -- --strict",
        "build:prod": "pnpm run build:vinext",
        "build:stg": "DEPLOY_ENV=stg pnpm run build:vinext",
        "deploy:prod": "pnpm run deploy:vinext",
        "deploy:stg": "DEPLOY_ENV=stg pnpm run deploy:vinext",
        "smoke:prod": "node scripts/smoke-identity.mjs production",
        "smoke:stg": "node scripts/smoke-identity.mjs stg",
        "lint:migracoes": "node scripts/lint-migracoes.mjs",
        "db:migrate:guarded": "node scripts/migrate-guarded.mjs",
        "db:migrate:unsafe": "pnpm --filter @venn/db exec prisma migrate deploy",
        "medir:recuperacao": "tsx scripts/medir-recuperacao.ts",
        "test:audio": "tsx scripts/test-audio.ts",
        "test:marcacao": "tsx scripts/test-marcacao.ts",
        "test:mencoes": "tsx scripts/test-mencoes.ts",
        "test:retratos": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/test-retratos.ts",
        "test:recortes": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/test-recortes.ts",
        "test:portao": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/test-portao.ts",
        "test:convite": "tsx --conditions=react-server scripts/test-convite.ts",
        "test:sonda": "tsx scripts/test-sonda.ts",
        "test:chunker": "tsx scripts/test-chunker.ts",
        "test:consulta": "tsx scripts/test-consulta.ts",
        "test:treinamento": "tsx scripts/test-treinamento.ts",
        "test:prompt": "tsx scripts/test-prompt.ts",
        "test:fusao": "tsx scripts/test-fusao.ts",
        "test:escalada": "tsx scripts/test-escalada.ts",
        "test:distribuicao": "tsx scripts/test-distribuicao.ts",
        "test:juiz": "tsx scripts/test-juiz.ts",
        "test:versao": "tsx scripts/test-versao.ts",
        "test:agrupar": "tsx scripts/test-agrupar.ts",
        "test:cenarios": "tsx scripts/test-cenarios.ts",
        "test:regras": "tsx scripts/test-regras.ts",
        "test:condicoes": "tsx scripts/test-condicoes.ts",
        "check:treinamento": "tsx scripts/check-treinamento.ts",
        "test:jid": "tsx scripts/test-jid.ts",
        "test:midia": "tsx scripts/test-midia.ts",
        "db:generate": "pnpm --filter @venn/db run generate"
    },
    "dependencies": {
        "@dnd-kit/core": "^6.3.1",
        "@dnd-kit/sortable": "^10.0.0",
        "@dnd-kit/utilities": "^3.2.2",
        "@hookform/resolvers": "^5.2.2",
        "@langchain/core": "^1.1.18",
        "@langchain/openai": "^1.2.4",
        "@langchain/textsplitters": "^1.0.1",
        "@neondatabase/serverless": "1.2.0",
        "@prisma/adapter-neon": "6.19.3",
        "@prisma/adapter-pg": "6.19.3",
        "@prisma/client": "6.19.3",
        "@types/bcryptjs": "^2.4.6",
        "@venn/config": "workspace:*",
        "@venn/db": "workspace:*",
        "@venn/ui": "workspace:*",
        "@vinext/cloudflare": "^1.2.0",
        "@xyflow/react": "^12.12.1",
        "aws4fetch": "1.0.20",
        "bcryptjs": "^3.0.3",
        "better-auth": "1.7.12",
        "bullmq": "^6.3.11",
        "class-variance-authority": "^0.7.1",
        "clsx": "^2.1.1",
        "cmdk": "^1.1.1",
        "cn": "^0.4.0",
        "date-fns": "^4.1.0",
        "ioredis": "^6.0.0",
        "lucide-react": "^0.563.0",
        "mammoth": "1.13.0",
        "next": "16.4.2",
        "next-themes": "^0.4.6",
        "openai": "^6.17.0",
        "pdf-parse": "^2.4.5",
        "pg": "8.16.3",
        "radix-ui": "^1.4.3",
        "react": "19.3.1",
        "react-day-picker": "^10.0.2",
        "react-dom": "19.3.1",
        "react-hook-form": "^7.71.1",
        "react-server-dom-webpack": "^19.3.1",
        "server-only": "^0.0.1",
        "sonner": "^2.0.7",
        "tailwind-merge": "^3.4.0",
        "typechat": "^0.1.1",
        "zod": "^4.3.6"
    },
    "devDependencies": {
        "@cloudflare/vite-plugin": "^2.0.0-beta.v.3",
        "@cloudflare/workers-types": "4.20251014.0",
        "@tailwindcss/postcss": "^4",
        "@types/node": "^20",
        "@types/react": "^19",
        "@types/react-dom": "^19",
        "@vitejs/plugin-react": "6.0.0",
        "@vitejs/plugin-rsc": "^0.5.38",
        "cf": "^1.0.0-beta.20",
        "eslint": "^9",
        "eslint-config-next": "16.4.2",
        "prisma": "6.19.3",
        "tailwindcss": "^4",
        "tsup": "^8.5.1",
        "tsx": "^4.23.15",
        "tw-animate-css": "^1.4.0",
        "typescript": "^5",
        "vinext": "1.3.0",
        "vite": "8.3.5"
    },
    "optionalDependencies": {
        "@next/swc-darwin-x64": "^16.1.6",
        "@tailwindcss/oxide-darwin-x64": "^4.1.18",
        "lightningcss-darwin-x64": "^1.31.1"
    },
    "overrides": {
        "@xmldom/xmldom": "0.8.15",
        "ws": "8.22.0"
    },
    "pnpm": {
        "// overrides": "ESPELHO do campo `overrides` acima, e não duplicação por descuido: `overrides` é campo do npm e o pnpm NÃO o lê — ele quer `pnpm.overrides`. Os dois pins são de segurança, e a primeira instalação com pnpm trouxe ws@8.21.0 em vez de 8.22.0, calada. O campo npm fica porque o repo ainda pode ser instalado com npm por quem clonar sem pnpm; os dois precisam andar juntos — mexeu em um, mexa no outro.",
        "overrides": {
            "@xmldom/xmldom": "0.8.15",
            "ws": "8.22.0"
        },
        "// onlyBuiltDependencies": "A lista que o pnpm pediu para autorizar — ele não roda postinstall de dependência sem permissão, e aqui estão os que instalam binário de plataforma (esbuild, que é quem o vite usa para transformar; workerd; os engines do Prisma) além do @prisma/client, que gera os dois clients. O log do builder mostra os seis terminando em ~2 segundos, então não custam tempo de build. Nota de honestidade: cheguei a remover esta lista achando que ela causava o travamento do build de 12/11 — não causava; o travamento era o vite seguindo os symlinks do pnpm, resolvido com `node-linker=hoisted` no .npmrc.",
        "onlyBuiltDependencies": [
            "@prisma/client",
            "@prisma/engines",
            "esbuild",
            "msgpackr-extract",
            "prisma",
            "unrs-resolver",
            "workerd"
        ]
    },
    "type": "module"
}
